      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].images.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Welcome to Moana Waters, our luxury resort nestled just inland of a
        tropical shore!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: Take some time to rest and relax after our adventures in Neon Nightscapes.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Just\u2026 try not to get too relaxed. You don\u2019t want to accidentally
        go above par! Or float away in that river\u2026 Happy putting!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].names.Array.data[1]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].names.Array.data[2]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: More ads!? CORPORATE must have really not liked how we did last quarter.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Anyways, welcome to Golf\u2019d Inc.\u2019s very own SERENE LAKE\u2122."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: " At this hole, there\u2019s the scenic route and the scary route, and
        I won\u2019t try to convince you which route to take but I will say watch
        out for that water hazard!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "It\u2019s very much water\u2026and even more hazardous!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[1].names.Array.data[2]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[1].names.Array.data[3]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Welcome to our HOT SPRINGS\u2122! You\u2019ll surely be relaxed after
        bathing in one of our natural geysers."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Although now that I think of it, CORPORATE has told me there\u2019s
        been some abnormal activity lately, so you might not want to stay too long."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: Good luck and happy putting!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Welcome to THE WATERFALL\u2122! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: You might not see the hole now, but just hit your ball into the water
        and see what happens!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[3].names.Array.data[1]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Look at that! An all-natural plinko machine that takes you right into
        a water cave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "It is a little dark in here\u2026 you know what, let's just get par
        before one of us gets spooked!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "I mean - before you get spooked. I\u2019m not scared at all!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Welcome to THE WATERWHEEL\u2122. But wait a minute\u2026I don\u2019t
        remember all these holes being around here."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "It\u2019s almost as if someone is digging for treasure, but I don\u2019t
        remember any pirates on this course."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[5].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "I\u2019m sure it\u2019s nothing. Good luck and happy putting!  "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[6].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Welcome to Golf\u2019d Inc.\u2019s very own PILE O\u2019 ROCKS\u2122.
        Famous for boasting nothing more than a pile of ro\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[6].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: WHY IS THERE A PIRATE SHIP HERE???
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[6].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: Try to bring the power back!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Alright. As your caddy, I am obligated to have a backup plan for every
        situation. Run!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Although, I guess we\u2019re stuck between a bunker and a hard place.
        If you can make it to the hole on the other side of the river, we can finish
        this hole and get out of here!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[7].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "I\u2019ve got it! Try to hit the ball right between the cannonballs.
        I\u2019m 9% confident you can make it through!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Sorry about the billboards by the way, Golf\u2019d Inc. has fallen
        on rough times recently with a decline in players and CORPORATE is trying
        all they can to keep these courses afloat"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Even if that means advertising, whatever \u201Creal golf\u201D is."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "\u2026okay this one is alright."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "\u201CThat might\u2019ve been a little rough, but I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll
        be on the green in no time!\u201D"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[8].lines.Array.data[4]
      value: Do you feel any more retained than you were previously?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[8].names.Array.data[4]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[9].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "I wonder where those pesky Woods went\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[9].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Well at least they\u2019re no longer interrupting the perfectly good
        round of minigolf we have going right now, am I right?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[9].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "\u2026am I right?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[9].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "It\u2019s very much water\u2026and even more hazardous!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[9].names.Array.data[3]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].images.Array.data[1]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc5df9a9b52d18d4dbcb7d8bc3e5549c,
        type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[0].images.Array.data[2]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc5df9a9b52d18d4dbcb7d8bc3e5549c,
        type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: As a caddy, those geysers were scary!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: I was nervous you were going to fly out of bounds!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "CORPORATE didn\u2019t seem to know about these extra holes--something\u2019s
        off here."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[10].names.Array.data[2]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Alright, I\u2019ll admit, I am a little spooked\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[11].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Well what are you waiting for? Let\u2019s get out of here!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Argh! That was a good putt matey! You\u2019ll be getting par-rgh on
        every hole in no time!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[12].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[13].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Big Puttz? That\u2019s the guy who\u2019s been buying up golf courses
        left and right! And now, he\u2019s trying to starve out ours!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[13].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "We have to stop him. Let\u2019s head to Goldberg to finish this 18-hole
        adventure and confront Big Puttz. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[13].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Also this is slightly awkward but due to wear and tear over the years,
        we\u2019ve exhausted this courses\u2019 Neon Nightscape holes."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[13].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "I\u2019ll meet you on our next course, Moana Water, for the remaining
        holes."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "CORPORATE would like me to extend you an official congratulations from
        all of us here at Golf\u2019d Inc. for making it to your first hole of the
        day!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: Wait a minute the hole is not here, is it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Try moving your phone--sorry--DIGITAL PUTTER\u2122 around to get a
        good look at the ground."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: If done properly, CORPORATE tells me you should see a grid of dots appear.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].lines.Array.data[4]
      value: After seeing the grid of dots, you will need to tap anywhere on that
        grid to place your level.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].lines.Array.data[5]
      value: "Once your level is placed, pressing and holding the screen of your
        DIGITAL PUTTER\u2122 will make your club appear."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].names.Array.data[3]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].names.Array.data[4]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[14].names.Array.data[5]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Uh oh, it looks like that disconnected the electricity for more than
        just the gate. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: Luckily, we just updated our golf balls to generate energy when hit
        which should keep the lights at low power for a short time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "Still, we should definitely find a way to get the power fully back
        on before CORPORATE realizes it\u2019s gone out."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].names.Array.data[0]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].names.Array.data[1]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1564932514128694432, guid: b7e550269444e4d25a5d2a3cd7ab2ec2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueEntries.Array.data[15].names.Array.data[2]
      value: I. Ron
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
